'''Techn-Old Hyena''' (テク・ノロ爺, ''Teku・Noro-jiji'', '''Tech Nolo-jiji''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]]/[[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sage]] variant of [[H. Nah]] introduced in [[Secluded Cavy Island]]. He was added in [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Techn-Old Hyena
|image = E 694.png
|first appearance = '''ZL:''' [[Yodoyo Sea|Sub-chapter 13 - Yodoyo Sea]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL:''' [[Pirates Breaking Rank|Sub-chapter 16 - Pirates Breaking Rank]]
|money drop = 1,505¢ - 5,944¢
}}

==Enemy==
He has lower range and attack power than a 200% [[Red EnerG]] (370/13,580 > 350/12,022), but hits up to 390 range with his Omni Strikes and trades the knockback ability for a guaranteed chance to Warp cats back by 1,200 range for almost 17 seconds. In addition to having the usual status resistances of [[:Category:Sage Enemies|Sages]], he is immune to Curse and [[Counter-Surge|duplicates]] any Surges that hit him.

==Strategy==
Due to his Sage typing, any and all crowd-control will be greatly resisted, although this isn't too relevant as status effects are rarely useful against [[H. Nah]] variants in the first place. Since being Immune to Curse allows his Warp to function without interference, [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Warp-immune units]] should be used so as to not clog up the Cat Deploy Limit with his long Warp duration. His Counter-Surge means [[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge Attackers]] are likewise not useful unless most or all cats you're using are Warp/[[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-immune]], as that will just cause him to teleport or instantly delete a massive group of units in the blink of an eye.

